Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=32}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir Crocodile...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:22.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh... Sir Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{As always, he came for us! - OG}I knew he'd come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Don't tell me it's the Crocodile, - OG}Crocodile?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{one of the Seven Warlords... - OG}From the Seven Warlords...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:31.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Silence, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:35.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I just came to get that pirate's head. - OG}I've only come for that pirate's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He's so wonderful... - OG}He's amazing...{Rin}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:40.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's what you always say,\Nbut you always save us. - OG}He always says that\Nbut saves us anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurray for Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Alabasta's guardian angel! - OG}Alabasta's guardian deity!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:50.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:50.19,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King of the desert! Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:58.83,Main-207-,,0,0,9,,Well, call me what you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:03.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Anyway, pirates, don't cause\Na ruckus in this country. - OG}Don't just think you can waltz in\Nand plunder this country, pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:07.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!\NAren't you underestimating us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:10.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Are you planning to take\Non all of us by yourself?! - OG}You thinking of taking us\Nall on by yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:14.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're the government's dog,\None who sold his soul to authority! - OG}You sold out to the authorities,\Nyou government dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Who do you think you are,\Nacting like a hero?! - OG}You think you're some kinda hero?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Those who don't wanna die,\Nlay down on the ground. - OG}Those who wish to live,\Nlay on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:22.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Is he an idiot or what?!\NHe's a perfect target for us! - OG}Is he stupid?! He's wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:26.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Get him! The money and the valuables\Nin this town are ours! - OG}Get him! He won't keep us\N{\q2}from this town's money and valuables!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:37.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So this is what the famous\NSeven Warlords are like?! - OG}Is this really a famous Warlord?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:17.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'm a pirate on a\Ndifferent level, you pig. - OG}I'm a whole different\Ncaliber of pirate, swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile! Crocodile! Crocodile!\NCrocodile! Crocodile! Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:02.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1410)}Crocodile again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was one step ahead again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.45,0:05:09.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{By the time we got to Nanohana,\Nit was already... - OG}By the time we got to Nanohana,\Nit was all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Either way, it's fine\Nas long as the citizens are okay. - OG}Either way, it's fine\Nas long as the citizens are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)}{He does a lot for us. - OG}We are indebted to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{This ship is heading to Alabasta. - OG}Our ship is heading to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Don't lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:33.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you looking away?\NLook me in the eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:43.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... um, really...\NI don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:44.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Then let me ask you something. - OG}Then answer me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:50.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How did enough food for 8 people, which I carefully divided so that it'd last until we get to Alabasta, - OG}{\q2}For this trip to Alabasta, I carefully procured\Nand divided enough food for eight people,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{disappear during the night? - OG}so how did it disappear\Nduring the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Stop fighting, it's pointless to try and fool me!\NYou've got a horrible poker face. - OG}It's pointless to try and fool me!\NYou've got the worst poker face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:04.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you have something\Naround your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Ah! Shoot! Food crumbs?! - OG}Ah! Shoot! Crumbs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{See, it was you! - OG}It {\i1}was{\i0} you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Geez... - OG}C'mon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Ah, Nami-[/i1]san[/i0]...\NYou saw it, right? - OG}Ah, Nami... You saw, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The large rat trap is no longer good enough. - OG}The large rat trap\Njust won't do anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:26.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Please buy a lockable refrigerator. - OG}Please buy a fridge with a lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:33.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{since it can be a life or death issue... - OG}since our lives may depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well... We'd better catch something for Sanji-[/i1]kun[/i0]. - OG}Well then! We'd better\Ncatch something for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, any luck fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I [/i1]feel[/i0] good... - OG}I {\i1}feel{\i0} lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Seriously, I can't take my eyes off these guys for a moment... - OG}I seriously can't turn\Nmy back for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.99,0:07:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh... I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:09.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fish aren't biting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:12.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Luffy! It's your fault!\NIt's because you even ate the bait! - OG}Luffy! It's your fault!\NI mean, you even ate the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't have bait,\Nthe fish won't bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You ate some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:20.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well... I only ate the\Nstuff on the bait box cover. - OG}That's... I only ate what was\Nstuck to the lid of the bait box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy{-san}. Usopp{-san}. Have you\Ncaught anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:29.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:32.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I wonder if we can\Ncatch a shark or something. - OG}He might catch us a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna catch a sea king.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What're you two... doing to Karoo?! - OG}Just what do you two think\Nyou're doing to Karoo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:46.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:53.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I wonder if it's cotton candy... - OG}Maybe it's cotton candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll go get Nami{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Nami-[/i1]san[/i0], there's a problem!\NCome right away! - OG}Nami, it's urgent! Come see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:11.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh... don't worry.\NIt's nothing. It's just steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:14.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Steam is coming up from the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's a hot spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's an area where magma is produced. - OG}It's an area where magma spews.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:22.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{There's an undersea volcano\Nunderneath the sea. - OG}There's an undersea volcano\Nbelow that area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:23.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I see... - OG}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A volcano even though it's undersea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:31.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's right. There're more undersea\Nvolcanoes than above ground ones. - OG}That's right. There are more volcanoes\Nunder the water than above it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:35.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.29,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{I don't really care...\Nsince it's not food. - OG}Who cares? We can't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{With the volcano like this,\Na new island will be born here - OG}With an active volcano here,\Na new island will be born
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:41.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,over thousands—\Nor tens of thousands—of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Nami{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:47.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tens of thousands of years...\NI wonder if I can live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:49.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well, you're a human. So you should\Ntry dying sometime before that... - OG}Nah, humans don't live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Have you caught anything? - OG}Caught anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:56.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Oh hey, Sanji. I'm hungry.\NCook something. - OG}Oh, Sanji. I'm hungry.\NCook something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:58.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys are hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:02.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'll go search the storage thoroughly\Nto see if there's anything left. - OG}I'll go upturn the storage\Nto see if anything's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:15.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Ahh! It smells of sulfur! - OG}Gah! It reeks of sulfur!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We can't see anything!\NThere's steam everywhere! - OG}We can't see a thing\Nwith steam everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bear with it. We should\Nbe through it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's smoke at twelve o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It doesn't matter! Cut through it! - OG}So what?! Sail right through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yes, sir! We're going in! - OG}Yes, sir! Going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What is this foggy thing? - OG}What's with the fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We can't see ahead! - OG}We can't see far!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:45.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:49.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Look for him in the cabins! - OG}Check inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:53.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:07.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Shoot! - OG}Aw, poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Why did I jump on the duck\Nthat I suddenly came across?! - OG}This duck came from out of nowhere,\Nand I {\i1}jumped{\i0} to it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:13.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Is he a human?\N– Dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?! Wahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:21.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:24.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't swim! I can't swi–
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:37.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd die...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well... I'm really very swanny. - OG}Well... I'm very {\i1}swan-swan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:45.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To think that I was saved\Nby pirates who are total strangers...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:48.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I will never forget your\Nkindness for the rest of my life! - OG}I will never forget your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:51.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, may I have\Na cup of warm soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We don't have it!}– Like we have it!\N– Like we have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who are hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Oh, hey you! - OG}Oh! Hey there, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:59.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What a cutie! - OG}Aren't you just the cutest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.89,0:11:02.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're my type!\NI wanna eat you! Smooch! - OG}Totally my type!\NI could just eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Such a weirdo... - OG}What a weirdo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.98,0:11:06.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you can't swim, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:10.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. I ate a devil fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? What kind of fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:18.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well... since there's no need to rush\Nuntil my ship comes to pick me up... - OG}Well, well... All we can do now is\Nwait for my ship to come pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{In lieu of entertainment,\NI'll show you... - OG}So perhaps I'll put on a little show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:24.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{This is my power! - OG}Behold my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:33.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I just told you that\Nthis is entertainment! - OG}Didn't I say this would be a "show"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:36.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Gimme a break! - OG}Nobody's clowning here!{Rin: We need to disuss this one. This is Bentham's catch phrase. It needs to be standardized.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:42.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's me! - OG}He's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surprised?! Surprised?! Surprised?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:49.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I touch my face\Nwith my left hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{See?! I'm back to myself! - OG}See?! Back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{This is the power\Nof the Clone-Clone Fruit I ate! - OG}This is the power\Nof the Clone-Clone Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The voice, too... - OG}Even his voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:57.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The body was also the same! - OG}His body was also the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:11:59.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:05.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well, for that matter,\NI don't have to knock you down... - OG}Ah! Come to think of it,\NI didn't {\i1}have{\i0} to knock you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Now, look! - OG}Because look...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{All I have to do is... - OG}All that's needed is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{touch faces with my right hand. - OG}to touch your faces\Nwith my right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:15.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I can
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,mimic anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.13,0:12:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bodies too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:22.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Stop it! - OG}Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.85,0:12:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:31.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well... sorry, but I can't\Nshow any more of my power... - OG}Oh, my... Unfortunately, that's all\NI'm willing to show of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're amazing! Do it some more! - OG}You're the best! Show some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:38.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh... Well... if you insist...\NI guess I'll show more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Show it! Show it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:41.12,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{Gee, it's not that exciting. - OG}It's not {\i1}that{\i0} exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then, I guess I'll show...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.62,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,We wanna see! We wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, I'm equipped\Nwith a memory feature!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Spin! Spin! Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How stupid! - OG}Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Spin! Spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So how was my secret talent?! - OG}So, did you like my special talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:14.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I usually never show it to others. - OG}It's rare for me to show it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Gimme a break! Gimme a break! - OG}Nobody's clowning here!\NNobody's clowning here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.62,0:13:25.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Amazing! He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:34.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's already time to say\Ngoodbye? What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Don't be sad! - OG}Chin up, and don't be sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Journeys are always\Naccompanied by farewells. - OG}Every voyage contains\Nsome farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:45.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But don't ever forget this. - OG}But... never forget this:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Friendship...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:52.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has nothing to do with how long\Nwe've known each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{See you again! - OG}Let's meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:14:00.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Now, let's go, guys! - OG}Now, let's go, boys!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:02.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Mr. 2 Bon Kurei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So he is... Mr. 2 Bon Kurei...! - OG}So then he's...\NMr. 2 Bon Kurei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Vivi! You didn't know his face?! - OG}Vivi! You've never seen him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:20.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{No... I've never met Mr. 2\Nand Mr. 1 as well as his partner. - OG}No... I've never met\NMr. 2 or the Mr. 1 duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know their powers, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{though I've heard of rumors... - OG}Though I've heard rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, Mr. 2 is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:35.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{a ballerina with a large frame...\Nwho talks like a woman... - OG}a lanky ballerina who talks\Nwith an effeminate voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.15,0:14:40.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He always wears a swan coat that\Nhas "Bon Kurei" on the back. - OG}He always wears a swan coat\Nthat displays "Bon Kurei" on its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.57,0:14:43.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– You should've noticed!\N– You should've noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:50.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Among the faces that he\Nshowed from his past memory... - OG}Among the faces that he pulled\Nfrom his past memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:52.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from his memory feature...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.37,0:14:54.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw my father's face...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:59.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the face of Alabasta's king,\NNefertari Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:04.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If, for example,\Nyou could mimic a king,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:07.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{you'd be able to do\Nquite bad things, too... - OG}you could get away\Nwith just about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We let a troublesome\Nguy slip away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:12.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Then he's our enemy? - OG}So he was our enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:16.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He's certainly quite a problem\Nif he's on our enemy's side. - OG}He's one hell of a problem\Nif he's on the opposing side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:20.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{If he realizes that we're his enemy... - OG}If he realizes that we're his enemies...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:24.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{If he transforms into one of us\Nusing his memory from earlier, - OG}If he transforms into one of us\Nusing his memory feature,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:27.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we won't be able to trust\Nour own friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:30.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Really? Huh? - OG}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy–
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:33.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well, hold on. - OG}Wait. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:36.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's true that his opinion\Ndoesn't have any basis, - OG}While it's true we might just be\Ngoing off Luffy's gut feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{but he's right about us not\Nhaving to be scared of him. - OG}I believe he's right to think\Nwe don't need to be scared of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We should consider ourselves lucky\Nthat we got to see him now... - OG}It's a stroke of luck\Nthat we met up with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:47.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{because we can figure\Nout counter-measures. - OG}because now we'll outsmart him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.39,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Un{\i0}, {\i1}deux{\i0}, {\i1}trois{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:51.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{in a very good mood for some reason. - OG}somehow in a very good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.93,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{How do you say 4?! - OG}What's "four" again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:56.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I found a small friendship! - OG}I made some new friends today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Something came out! - OG}Something popped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:09.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A sea cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{MOVING SUBS?}{It's the first meal in four days! - OG}It's our first meal in four days!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's a meal! - OG}It's food!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I hope we get there pretty soon. - OG}I hope we get there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's a meal! - OG}Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Whoa! It backed away! - OG}Whoa! It's backing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:29.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Have the ship go back! Go back! - OG}Go back! Full reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-W-W-W-W-W-We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:33.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:37.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Don't let it get away!\NCapture it without fail! - OG}Don't let it get away!\NWe {\i1}have{\i0} to capture it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How should I cook you, cat monster?! - OG}Now, how would you like\Nto be cooked, cat monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{No! - OG}You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi! You jerk! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:53.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh... Why... Vivi{-chan}?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:59.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sea cats are a sacred\Nanimal in Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You should've told us sooner! - OG}Tell us sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{There sure are many kinds\Nof creatures in the sea! - OG}The sea's full of all kinds of creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Being scared of things like that...\NYou've still got a long way to go... - OG}You've got a ways to go if you're\Nscared of things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:08.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:13.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'll tell you a story about when I bravely fought Sea Kings in the Calm Belt. - OG}Here's a story all about how I bravely\Nfought off sea kings in the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Fought Sea Kings?! - OG}Fought off sea kings?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big ones! They were {\i1}this{\i0} big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:21.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-Our food got away...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:24.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But don't worry. You'll be\Nable to stuff yourself soon. - OG}It will all be okay! You'll soon\Nhave plenty to fill your belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Really?! What cat will appear this time?! - OG}Really?! What kind of cat\Nwill appear next time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:32.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Vivi! The wind and weather\Nseem to be becoming stable. - OG}Vivi! The wind and weather\Nseem to be stabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:33.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've entered\NAlabasta's climate area.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{A sea cat appearing is also the proof. - OG}A sea cat appearing\Nis a sure sign, too.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{And what we see behind us... - OG}And just look behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:43.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{is probably also proof\Nof Alabasta being close... - OG}More proof Alabasta's\Nclose by, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:57.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are so many ships!\NWhen did that happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:18:02.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey! They all have\Nthe Baroque Works' symbol! - OG}Hey! They're all flying\NBaroque Works' colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its employees have started gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:10.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{They're probably billions...\Nthe officer agents' subordinates. - OG}They're most likely the billions,\Nthe officer agents' subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:14.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Which means that our\Nenemy is at least 200... - OG}Then there are at least\N200 men out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:17.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{On top of that, they are the\N200 elites of Baroque Works... - OG}In point of fact, they're\Nthe 200 elites of Baroque Works.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:21.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{They're far from those bounty\Nhunters in Whisky Peak. - OG}The bounty hunters at\NWhisky Peak don't even compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:24.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Should we fire at them\Nwhile we can?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Let's get on it already! - OG}Let's get the drop on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's quicker if we go\Nthere and beat them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{No, wait! We have to eat first! - OG}No, wait! We gotta eat first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Idiot! Don't bother. They're small fries. - OG}It'd be dumb to bother\Nwith those small-timers.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:38.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.97,0:18:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{If we lose our real target, that'll be it. - OG}If we lose sight of our\Nreal target, we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{There're only 8 of us. - OG}And there are only eight of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:49.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Anyway, tie it tight. - OG}Just... tie it tightly.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Our enemy this time\Nhas too many mysteries. - OG}Our enemy this time\Nis overly secretive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.23,0:18:52.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I see... - OG}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{If we check this, we don't\Nhave to doubt our friends. - OG}These will help us tell\Nwho our {\i1}real{\i0} crewmates are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:59.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that Clone-Clone Fruit guy really
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,become so similar\Nwhen he transforms?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:05.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You've no idea! It's not "similar." - OG}Seeing is believing!\NIt's not just "similar,"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:06.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's "the same"! - OG}it's identical!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too bad! You should've seen it.\NWe even danced with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:15.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Knowing someone like that\Nis among our enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we can't carelessly act alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:26.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh... Do what you {\i1}can{\i0} do.\NYou don't have to do anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:29.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's okay to run away from\Nthe enemy you can't defeat! - OG}It's okay to run away from\Nan enemy you can't defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:32.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to him or yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What I can do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:37.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can see the island now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:43.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Let's stop at the town called Nanohana.\NWe have to hide the ship. - OG}We'll visit Nanohana, that town ahead,\Nbut we need to hide the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:47.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Alright! At any rate\Nno matter what happens, - OG}Alright! So, no matter what happens,{Reverie 2 - 25:18}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{this thing on our left arm is\Nthe sign of our friendship! - OG}our left arms prove\Nthat we're definitely crewmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well then, we'll land! - OG}Now, let's get ashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To a restaurant!\NOh, and to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's a side note? - OG}– As a side note?\N– As a side note?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:06.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The enemy this time is an\Nassassination gang, Luffy. - OG}Our enemy this time is\Na group of assassins, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.89,0:20:08.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, it is. - OG}Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:11.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be careful about acting\Non instinct, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:16.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right. I got it.\NYeah! That's right! Yeah! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's going on?\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Oh. It seems someone suddenly died in the restaurant. - OG}Oh. It seems someone\Nkeeled over in that restaurant.{Z -"keeled over" is more fun, and it already has the connotation of being sudden. Now it fits the next line better.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:37.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Suddenly died?! - OG}Keeled over?!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He supposedly died in the middle\Nof a conversation with the owner! - OG}He seems to have died in the middle\Nof a conversation with the proprietor!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He's a traveler. - OG}He's an out-of-towner.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:48.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We think he unwittingly ate\Na desert strawberry while traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A desert strawberry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:54.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're poisonous spiders that\Nlook like red strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:58.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eat one by accident, and you'll\Nsuddenly drop dead a few days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Contagious poison spreads through\Nthe corpse for a few hours after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:05.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so nobody can get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the desert, what you\Ndon't know can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:15.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Just look! The way he's\Nstill stuck holding the meat - OG}Just look! The way he's stuck\Nin that position, still holding the meat,{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:19.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is proof of just how powerful\Nthe desert strawberry's poison is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He came back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:34.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.78,0:21:41.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Oh, whoops. - OG}Oh, my bad.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I fell asleep. - OG}I dozed off.{Z - Wano 55 - 02:31}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You were asleep?! - OG}– That was dozing off?!\N– That was dozing off?!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:48.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Th-That's absurd! You were in the middle of a conversation and a meal! - OG}R-Ridiculous! You were in the middle\Nof a conversation and a meal!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{And now he's eating again! - OG}And he's right back to eating!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What's all this commotion, anyway? - OG}So what's the big fuss?{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:57.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– We were worried you'd died!\N– We were worried you'd died!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:00.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Does this restaurant do comedy skits or something? - OG}Is this restaurant known\Nfor comedy routines?{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.59,0:22:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{No, it's not like that.\NBut it's good you're alright. - OG}No, it's not like that.\NBut we're glad you're okay.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:08.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey, now! Don't sleep again! - OG}– Hey! Don't just pass out again!\N– Hey! Don't just pass out again!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Aw, so he wasn't dead after all? - OG}Huh? So he wasn't really dead?{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:16.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just a false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:27.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That hit the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:28.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.49,0:22:30.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Has this guy been in town? - OG}You seen this guy in town?{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:34.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He's a pirate who wears a straw hat... - OG}He's a pirate with a straw hat...{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'm impressed you're bold enough to eat out in public... - OG}You've got a lot of guts\Neating out in public,{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Second Division commander\Nof the Whitebeard Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,Portgas D. Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-Whitebeard?!\N{\i1}The{\i0} Whitebeard Pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:54.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That dimwit is one of the Whitebeard Pirates?! - OG}That numbskull is one of\Nthe Whitebeard Pirates?!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Come to think of it, I have seen the mark on his back before! - OG}You know, I recognize\Nthe tattoo on his back!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.44,0:23:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the mark\Nof the Whitebeard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.19,0:23:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.65,0:23:06.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What is a famous, big-shot pirate doing in this country? - OG}What's a famous, big-shot pirate\Ndoing in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'm searching... - OG}Just looking...{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.17,0:23:19.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{for my little brother! - OG}for my kid brother!{Z}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=33}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=36}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
